# EGT sweep artefacts written to the REPO ROOT rather than app/generated/.
# The defaults are now anchored to `app/` so this should not happen, but
# `--out-root generated/egt` from here still would, and one sweep is ~120
# files. The tracked copy lives under app/generated/ with its own rules.
/generated/
